---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Applications & Systems Administrator based in Carmel, Indiana, focused on Apple device management."
>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container-narrow about-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm the admin behind The Managed Mac.</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        I'm an Applications &amp; Systems Administrator based in Carmel, Indiana,
        focused on Apple device management — MDM, endpoint security, and the
        automation that keeps a fleet of Macs and iPhones healthy without
        needing constant hands-on attention.
      </p>

      <p>
        Day to day, that means Apple Business Manager, enrollment and
        provisioning, configuration profiles, patch and update compliance,
        and enough shell scripting to automate the parts of the job that
        shouldn't require a human. This site is where I write down what
        actually works — the configurations, scripts, and troubleshooting
        notes I'd want to find if I were searching for them myself.
      </p>

      <h2>What I focus on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Mobile device management platforms (Jamf Pro and others) and Apple's MDM protocol, including Declarative Device Management.</li>
        <li>Apple Business Manager, Automated Device Enrollment, and zero-touch provisioning.</li>
        <li>Endpoint security baselines, patch management, and compliance reporting.</li>
        <li>Shell and Swift scripting to automate day-to-day fleet administration.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        If something here is wrong, out of date, or you just want to compare
        notes on an MDM headache, <a href="/contact/">reach out</a> — I'm
        always glad to talk shop with other admins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
